  "articleBody": "A successful bathroom addition starts with a defined location, measured existing conditions, a realistic scope, and a provider who can coordinate design, permits, construction, and inspections. Before requesting proposals, decide who will use the room, what features matter most, and whether the work expands the building or reworks existing interior space.",
